{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id362907652"}, "name":{"label":"kiifsw"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-19T05:31:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.71.0"}, "id":{"label":"14201100066"}, "title":{"label":"The update is too frequent with no user experience"}, "content":{"label":"I can’t express more of my disappointment when I managed to proceed to payment for a extremely popular product online, while HSBC app once again ask for an update, before I can verify the credit card transaction. It takes me more than 3 minutes and hence I am not able to pay for the product, which was then out of stock. The app’s update is always too frequent and there is no exemption for certain action (card transaction verification) to bypass the update. This is a super bad design and I would like to cut my card because of this poor experience.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=1164066737&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
